+and figure titles now name both levels, and points.csv has the columns calibration_coverage_target and
+check_coverage_target next to the historical tier key; every recorded value is unchanged. --delivered-labels writes
+the captions and columns of the files delivered on 2026-11-22 (their SHA256 are in checksums/originals.sha256).
